  "description": "Unleash your inner adventurer. With our HAIBIKE ALLTRACK 10, that’s more than possible. A hardtail eMTB that blends comfort with sporty performance – on the road, in the woods or out on the trail. Thanks to the latest Bosch Performance Line CX motor, you benefit from cutting-edge drive technology. The large 800Wh battery – extendable with a 250Wh range extender – gives you plenty of range for long tours. Other features like the 120mm RockShox suspension fork, grippy SRAM DB4 disc brakes, wide Schwalbe knobbly tyres and dropper post keep you comfortable on any terrain. Practical: sizes M to XL roll on 29\" wheels, size S comes with 27.5\". Ready for your next adventure?",
